                "text": "Wishing our Jewish friends celebrating Rosh Hashanah a happy new year.\n \nAs you spend the next two days in prayer and reflection, may the new year bring peace, health, and prosperity to you and your loved ones.\n \nWe also pray for the safety of Israel and all those affected in yesterday\u2019s attack. America will always stand with Israel.",
