                "text": "The opioid epidemic has devastated Ohio families. \n\n@RepPaulTonko and I passed the MAT Act in 2022 requiring health care providers to help those struggling with addiction. Today, we inquired about how they're eliminating barriers to treatment.\n\nRead more:\nhttps://t.co/MAAdnQa9pL",
