                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "This updated assessment by ODNI concerning new intelligence on Anomalous Health Incidents, also known as \u201cHavana Syndrome,\u201d continues the Biden Administration\u2019s cover-up.\n\nThis new intelligence, I believe, should completely change the assessment of our adversaries\u2019 capabilities and the risks to our personnel.\n\nThis will not age well for the Biden Administration.",
