                "text": "Ensuring access to necessary medical care for individuals awaiting trial is not just a matter of fairness\u2014 it\u2019s a matter of public safety and fiscal responsibility.\n\nI'm proud to reintroduce the Due Process Continuity of Care Act with @RepSTurner, @RepRutherfordFL, and @RepPaulTonko, which will provide a practical solution for preventing untreated health conditions from escalating, reducing burdens on local law enforcement, and helping communities avoid higher long-term costs.\nhttps://t.co/5eYc3VQe3C",
